    <string name="privacy_body">Muslim ku sirri massakaxxaah, ku oyti gaaboysam maduuda.\n\n• Kattat mali: SDKs, analytics kee marketing trackers hinna.\n• Oyti ku aalatal yan: inkih tan oyti (arac, setting, bookmarks) ku aalatal yan:90d dubuk. koobaahise salat wakti kee qibla ku aalatal lowsiisoonuh edde yantifiqen, kee inkinah faxe iroh yan server fanah ruubaanam hinna.\n• Idinitte faxximta wak dubuk: nanu essernam faxximta wak dubuk (arac, maysaxxagoogi) inkih tan feature nummaak ken faxximta wak, qado baxxaqsa luk.\n• the Noline work: network maqnisso inkih doorit le ekstras axcih lowsis obsiyyi.\n\nTa poliisi fakut tan raceenah lowsis exxa kinnim kee ayyuntiinô lowsis fakut tan.</string>
